{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1e4e9585-e46f-8d52-a858-63d2771f4e78",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T09:00:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Stephen Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:56:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:56:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Yes, I want to put a fence in my yard, and I want to know what are the rules for this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:56:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Can I get your name and the address where the fence would go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:56:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stephen Thurston. The address is 257 Carroll Avenue, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Thurston. And tell me a little about what you're planning. What kind of fence, how tall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:56:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is a chain-link fence, five feet tall. The reason is my dog. He is very fast, and he slips out of the yard when we open the door. I want to keep him inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that makes sense. Is it going all the way around the yard, or just part of it, like the back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Around the back and the sides. Not in the front, only to the corner of the house. Is this okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful to know. So your main question is whether you need a permit for it, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. I need a permit for a fence, or no? And is there paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:36-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In general, yes, a fence usually does need a permit here, so you'd want to apply before any work starts. There's a short application, and you'd describe the type, the height, and where it goes on the lot. Height and placement are the things we look at most, especially near the street and the property lines."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So before I buy the material, I should do the application first. I understand correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Apply first, get the approval, then build. That way if something has to change, you haven't already paid for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:58:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And the five feet, this is a problem for the rules? Or it depends where it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can depend on where it sits on the property. Backyard and side yard are treated differently than the front. Since yours stops at the corner of the house, that's the right way to describe it on the form. The reviewer will confirm the height for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:58:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. And I need a survey? Of my property? I ask because I don't know if I have one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:58:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. A survey isn't always required, but it helps a lot to know where your property line is. Do you have a plot plan from when you bought the house, maybe in your closing papers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:58:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe yes. I have a folder with papers from the purchase. There is a drawing, I think, but I don't know if is a survey."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:59:07-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Find that drawing and bring it in or send a copy with the application. If it shows the lot lines and the house, it may be enough for a simple fence. If the reviewer needs more, they'll tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:59:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I bring the drawing, and they tell me if I need another thing. Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:59:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. You can come to the counter at City Hall, and we'll give you the application. We're open this morning and through the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:59:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can come this week. Do I need to bring something else? An ID, or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:59:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The drawing, a simple sketch of where the fence goes, and the details you told me: chain-link, five feet, back and sides. That's plenty to start. If you want, I'll note that you called, so whoever helps you knows what it's about."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T09:00:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. That is very nice. Honestly, I love how friendly everyone is on the island. Every time I ask something, people help me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T09:00:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's kind of you to say. Let me read back what I have. Stephen Thurston, 257 Carroll Avenue, chain-link fence, five feet, back and side yards, wanting to know about the permit and a survey. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T09:00:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. And my phone is 401-555-0187, if somebody needs to call me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T09:00:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0187. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T09:00:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T09:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Thurston. Have a good day, and good luck with the dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T09:00:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
